I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment call. The graph doesn't grant this node that capability yet, and the spec would send the digest's text (scraped from external feeds) to an external host in a URL while keeping the output unchanged, so the call would be invisible. The node below publishes through the declared `notifier` capability only. Once the graph definition actually grants `http-client` and the enrichment spec is settled, that call can be added as a separate change.

